# sapintegrationsuite_access_policy (Data Source)

Finds an access policy by `role_name` or by `id`. The role name is the portable choice: the same
policy has a different numeric ID in every tenant. Use it to attach references to a policy owned
elsewhere, or to find the ID for an import.

**Status:** supported.

If no policy matches, the plan fails.

